Expected Outcomes
A running Spring Boot and Apache Camel application exposing REST endpoints that demonstrate Content-Based Router, Splitter, and Aggregator patterns end to end
Application logs and files under data/aggregated-orders/ that clearly show orders being routed by content, split from a batch, and aggregated into grouped summaries with correct totals
